  "description": "Triangulation of polygonal faces at mesh import (12-mesh-import.md section 3): the triangles Painter splits each polygon of an OBJ into, identified from its Position bake of non-planar quads, a pentagon and hexagons, against the rule of UzPainter's production importer (src/mesh/mesh_builder.cpp).",
