      "entry_id": "polygon-split",
      "subject": "Triangles a face c0 .. c(n-1) of an imported OBJ is split into",
      "status": "exact",
      "formula": "A face c0 .. c(n-1) with n > 3 becomes the fan from its last corner: the triangles (c[i], c[i+1], c(n-1)) for i = 0 .. n-3, following the face's corner order whatever the polygon's shape, planarity or shortest diagonal; a quad is split along c1-c3.",
